# idl/natives.list — the subsystems (IDL basenames) the natives emitter
# (gen/emit_natives.mjs) generates for, one per line. A subsystem listed here
# must be carried by the bronze native vocabulary in full: every member the
# vocabulary refuses is either respelled in the IDL or marked [manual].
#
# Everything not listed is documented (docs, .d.ts) but has no generated
# natives yet.
time
window
settings
paths
mesh
lm
dunder_bro
rigging
net
physics
scene
terrain
clipmap
tile_world
lighting
animation
gizmo
rave
motion
mic
sense
gesture
